Plain language

You may:
- copy, read, and use this repository
- adapt the instructions for your own literature review
- share your version, as long as it stays non-commercial and under this
  same license
- use the example articles to judge the quality of the workflow

You may not:
- sell this project, a clone of it, or a paid “automatic paper review”
  service
- fold this workflow into a commercial product (software, packaged
  consultancy, or a paid course whose main content is this repo)
- strip this restriction and republish the work as MIT or public domain

Citing the repository in a thesis, paper, or academic report is allowed.
That is not commercial use.

If you need a commercial license, contact the copyright holder.
Until then, no commercial use is granted.

